							<h2 class="card-title bold h3">
								<a name="Rotary_Screw_Air_Compressors">Rotary Screw Air Compressors</a>
							</h2>
						</div>
						<div class="card-body">
							<p>A rotary screw is a compressor which utilizes two intermeshing helical rotors to trap a volume of air, then compress it to a higher pressure. Rotary screw compressors can be run at lower temperatures, and for 24 hours a day, 365 days a year. These compressors are all stationary, and generally have a specific air piping system that runs through the warehouse, industrial plant or shop in which it is located. Many local shops that we have seen also use regular air hose for its flexibility and mobility.</p>
